## Rows skipped

ms-a 12 — turn Q16–Q20 into `##` headings.
Reason: Korean keeps Q16–Q20 as plain lines. `checkHeadings` compares heading levels. ACCEPTED-ROUND says not to add headings.

ms-a 13 and ms-b 29 — delete U+200B blank lines (003 Q16–Q20, 005 including `**​**`, 006, 008, 009, 013, 015).
Reason: `checkBlocks` requires the target ZWSP count to equal the Korean source. A line that contains only U+200B is a non-empty block. Deleting it fails both the ZWSP count and the block count. 009’s five ZWSP lines match the Korean source and were left.

ms-a 19 P3 — drop the leading space on `servicesAssistanceAfter`.
Reason: not applied. See disagreements. The spaces are on opposite sides of the Hubungi link.

ms-a 20 P3 — “Baca selanjutnya” → “Baca seterusnya”.
Reason: `ColumnsGrid.tsx` hard-codes the same CTA, and `columns-grid-guidance-labels.test.tsx` requires the rendered card to equal `home.columnsReadMoreLabel`. That component is outside this lane’s write list. Changing only the guidance string fails the test.

## Systemic patterns

- “justifikasi” standing in for supporting documents → “dokumen sokongan”: 20 nouns (001×1, 002×9, 010×1, 014×6, 016×3). Related verbs: 003 “dijustifikasikan” → “dibuktikan” (1); 005 “menjustifikasikan” → “membuktikan” (1).
- “memandang” meaning “in light of” → “memandangkan”: 4 (010×1, 014×3). Existing “memandangkan” left.
- “objek” as the thing a rule covers or the subject of a review: 18 (004 penyenaraian ×3, pengisytiharan ×2, peraturan ×1; 011 denda ×1; 014 semakan ×1 and pemulangan ×1; 015 proactive-inquiry label ×3; 016 pewarisan ×1, pengiraan ×3, semakan ×1; 018 “Contoh objek” ×1). “objek bukti”, “objek modal”, “objek pindahan”, “objek sebenar” and “objek pengurangan modal” left; those name a subject matter, and 001–002 were not in this calque’s finding list.
- 但書 called “rizab”: 5 in 007 (FAQ, body, and the three later proviso mentions). Surplus “rizab” / “rizab berkanun” left.
- “penghutang pampasan”: 2 (010 and the same sentence in 003). “penghutang nafkah” in 007 left.
- “masuk ke dalam” for “falls within”: 3 (011, 012, 004).
- “mereka bentuk” as two words: 2 (011, 018).
- Work permit “lesen kerja” / “lesen kediaman” → “permit”: 013×1, 017×6, 018 kerja ×3 and kediaman ×2.
- English modifier stack / place before the object: 011 brand ×1, 013 bank account ×1, 017 carrier ×1, 018 title and H1 ×2, opening sentence ×1, subject-line example ×1.
- Indonesian “pengajuan”: 1 (003).

