## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)

ms-a 19. The Before string ends with a space and the After string starts with a space, but they sit on opposite sides of the link: `…halaman ` + Hubungi + ` menerangkan…`. That is one space before the link and one space after it. Dropping the After space would render “Hubungimenerangkan”.

The ZWSP and Q16-heading rows are not factual errors. They ask for a structure change the checker pins to the Korean source.
